 "note": "คีย์ชนิดข้อมูล (path/id/ธง) ถูกตัดออกแล้วโดย mark_dnt.py — แปลเฉพาะที่เหลือ",
 "strings": {
  "Yeah, well, what are\nwe gonna do about it?": "",
  "Aren't you in a rush?": "",
  "Wait your turn, sir!": "",
  "Don't be so hasty!": "",
  "Now that explains it...": "",
  "Oh, yeah, of course!": "",
  "Ah, now I understand!": "",
  "Huh, is that so?": "",
  "Sure, no problem!": "",
  "I've been so busy lately,\nhaven't had a moment's rest.": "",
  "Been burning the\nmidnight oil lately...": "",
  "It is what it is!": "",
  "Okay, it's a plan!": "",
  "Is that right!?": "",
  "Sure, sounds good!": "",
  "That sounds good to me!": "",
  "We've got a deal!": "",
  "Yeah, that's right.": "",
  "As far as I know...": "",
  "Mmhmm, I think so.": "",
  "How are things going for you?": "",
  "This is dumb!": "",
  "Yeah, I heard you, but still...": "",
  "You expect me to\nswallow that whole story?": "",
  "This place is amazing!": "",
  "Hm. Maybe I shoulda\ntried that...": "",
  "Ooh, pretty nice piece\nyou got there.": "",
  "Ooh, where'd you buy that?": "",
  "Where can I find one like that?": "",
  "Who sells something\nlike that around here?": "",
  "Not bad. Not bad at all.": "",
  "Ooh! That sounds fun!": "",
  "Come on, just a little bit!": "",
  "So what, it ain't here?\nWhere is it?": "",
  "That's all I've got!": "",
  "Yeah! Right over there!": "",
  "Yes, that's it!": "",
  "Ugh, I've had enough\nof the city today...": "",
  "What? Is that true!?": "",
  "No fooling!?": "",
  "Huh. About time!": "",
  "Not a moment too soon!": "",
  "I need to head home.": "",
  "The kids are waiting\nfor me at home.": "",
  "I should be getting home.": "",
  "Wow, didn't know you could\nget such a good deal here!": "",
  "Ain't so bad, from time to time!": "",
  "Hey! Don't just sneak\nup on a guy!": "",
  "Just a wee bit, you say?": "",
  "I could take a little peek.\nWho'd mind?": "",
  "Let's go take a look, huh?": "",
  "Give me a minute, will ya?": "",
  "Hey, listen up, stupid!": "",
  "What do you want me\nto do about it?": "",
  "Where are you off to!?": "",
  "Where was that place\nhe told me about?": "",
  "Where was it at?": "",
  "What's up, brother?": "",
  "Hm? Can I help you?": "",
  "How do you plan on\nmaking this up to me?": "",
  "Well, what do they\nexpect me to do?": "",
  "Geez, how hungry can you be?": "",
  "Hold on, what's happening?": "",
  "Oh, I see.\nSo that's how it is...": "",
  "What is that thing?": "",
  "What's going on?": "",
  "What? What the hell!?": "",
  "Ah, I love this town!": "",
  "Rambunctious folk around here...": "",
  "Phew...": "",
  "*sigh* What a day...": "",
  "Can't you work any faster?\nI'm in a hurry!": "",
  "Come on, hurry it up!": "",
  "Get a move on, would you!?": "",
  "That's all.\nI've got to be going.": "",
  "That's a beautiful song...": "",
  "Okay! We'll go there after!": "",
  "I'll see you again soon,\nwon't I?": "",
  "See you later!": "",
  "Give me one of those\nand two of these...": "",
  "All right, you sold me!": "",
  "See you!": "",
  "Goodbye!": "",
  "Righty-oh! Another time, then!": "",
  "Now, let's go.": "",
  "You must be new here.": "",
  "Great day for a walk.": "",
  "It's too early for this.": "",
  "You've got a point there!": "",
  "I suppose you're\nright about that...": "",
  "Now this is real fun!": "",
  "Ha ha ha! Hee hee!\nI'm laughin' to death!": "",
  "Sure, this'll do!": "",
  "Mm. Not bad, could be worse.": "",
  "Well, could always go\nfor another drink, I guess!": "",
  "Hey, come on, hear me out...": "",
  "Hey, just leave it to me!": "",
  "I didn't want to believe it,\nbut...": "",
  "Haha! Really?": "",
  "That's a laugh!": "",
  "Haha, you're kidding!": "",
  "Ugh, how much longer\ndo we have to walk?": "",
  "Wait for meee!": "",
  "Honestly, I'm happy for ya!": "",
  "What? I can't hear you\nover the crowd!": "",
  "Want to hit up one more place?": "",
  "There's gotta be\nsomewhere else to go!": "",
  "Come on, buddy, one more spot\nand we'll call it quits!": "",
  "Time for me\nto be gettin' home...": "",
  "Why's everybody so loud?": "",
  "Ugh, it's noisy out here!": "",
  "Oh, it finally came\nto me in a dream!": "",
  "Hey, forget about it, okay?": "",
  "Don't even worry about it, okay?": "",
  "I think I might be a genius!": "",
  "Huh, is this somebody's wallet?": "",
  "I swear on your mother,\nit's true!": "",
  "Would I lie to you, pal?\nTrust me!": "",
  "Oh, really?": "",
  "Seriously?": "",
  "Every word of it—true!": "",
  "Hold on, I need to rest.": "",
  "Gotta take a quick breather...": "",
  "Looking for a good time?": "",
  "You know, things haven't been\ntoo bad around here lately.": "",
  "Oh, been a while, hasn't it?": "",
  "I didn't hop off the palanquin\nto Kyo yesterday, buddy!": "",
  "Take me there next time!": "",
  "Hey, my treat today! Join me!": "",
  "Hoo boy! I made out\nlike a bandit today!": "",
  "Hey, my treat today!": "",
  "Why don't we just\ngo home for the day?": "",
  "Can't we talk about\nsomething classy for once?": "",
  "That place has some great food!": "",
  "I'm getting hungry,\nlet's eat something.": "",
  "What's good around here?": "",
  "What do you think\nyou're looking at!?": "",
  "My talents are only\njust starting to bloom!": "",
  "How kind of you, sir!": "",
  "You're looking full\nof energy as always!": "",
  "I'm going on ahead!\nMeet me there!": "",
  "I have to say, I'm shocked!": "",
  "Imagine that!": "",
  "Well, that's bad news...": "",
  "I should pick up some souvenirs\nfor folks while I'm here.": "",
  "My wife's gonna kill me!": "",
  "You're really having\na laugh now!": "",
  "Come on,\na little bit won't hurt...": "",
  "Just a little bit...": "",
  "Why don't you put your feet up?": "",
  "You look tired.": "",
  "Seems pretty suspicious to me...": "",
  "You did well!": "",
  "I'll treat ya to\nwhatever ya want!": "",
  "Mmm! That was fantastic!": "",
  "Well, aren't you gregarious?": "",
  "Things were good\nin the old days...": "",
  "Business seems good around here.": "",
  "Any good deals\nin the market today?": "",
  "I lost every tag\nI had to my name...": "",
  "Oh, wonderful!": "",
  "I'm feeling good, let's go sing!": "",
  "Be careful on your way back!": "",
  "Take care, miss!": "",
  "You're the generous\nsort, ain'tcha?": "",
  "This place sure is lively.": "",
  "Mm, this is soothing.": "",
  "It's good to get out\nonce in a while.": "",
  "Today's a good day.": "",
  "It's peaceful at\nthis time of day.": "",
  "Impressive, I have to say.": "",
  "That's supposed to be\ngood luck, I hear.": "",
  "Seems like business is good.": "",
  "Nice seeing you!": "",
  "Oh, you again?": "",
  "Well, that's great!": "",
  "I'll be around later\nif you need something.": "",
  "Looking good today!": "",
  "Feeling relaxed?": "",
  "Could always go hit up\nthe gambling den...": "",
  "Hey, why don't we try\nmaking some money on dice?": "",
  "I know a good shortcut, look!": "",
  "Want to play a game?": "",
  "How long's it been since\nwe went out for the night?": "",
  "I could be persuaded\nto stop for a drink...": "",
  "Well, isn't this just cheery?": "",
  "I don't always do this, but...": "",
  "The day's still young!": "",
  "Sure, I'll grab a bite.": "",
  "Which way'd he go?": "",
  "Geez, I'm exhausted!": "",
  "Don't be talkin' that shit here!": "",
  "Oi! You're trying to\nstart something!?": "",
  "So, where'd they\nhaul you out from?": "",
  "You must have some booze\nstashed somewhere! Come on!": "",
  "Keep your guard up!\nYou want to get run through!?": "",
  "You're an embarrassment\nto the entire corps!": "",
  "I'll make a man of you yet!": "",
  "These old wounds\nwon't stop hurting...": "",
  "This is just between us, got it?": "",
  "Be glad these are\nwooden swords, kid.": "",
  "You owe me for this.\nDon't forget it.": "",
  "Damn impressive work today.": "",
  "Okay, let's go.": "",
  "I suppose we could...": "",
  "Get up! You're sitting\nin my spot!": "",
  "What's with the attitude?": "",
  "Be glad that was only a scratch!": "",
  "Is that an order, sir?": "",
  "You want to take me on!?\nYou're dreaming!": "",
  "Heh! Too easy!": "",
  "What's even going on here!?": "",
  "Move! You're in the way!": "",
  "Wanna see who's\nstronger—you or me?": "",
  "Eh? You need something?": "",
  "Ha! What do you think of that!?": "",
  "Ah, damn it! What the hell?": "",
  "I've worked up a mighty thirst.\nTime for a drink.": "",
  "Hahaha! What a riot!": "",
  "We've got a long way to go, men.": "",
  "Damn it! Go again!": "",
  "I need to improve my technique!": "",
  "I wanna fight someone strong!": "",
  "Shut up already!": "",
  "Just forget it.": "",
  "All right, let's begin!": "",
  "Hm? Care for something to drink?": "",
  "Hm? Your blade is dull.\nGet it sharpened, on the double!": "",
  "Hm? You need something?": "",
  "Hm? Never seen\nyou around before...": "",
  "Quit messing around!": "",
  "Good behavior is vital for any militia!": "",
  "I'll take you on any time,\nbet on it!": "",
  "I've earned myself\na long break, I think.": "",
  "Heheh, I can hardly\ncontain myself!": "",
  "I'm gettin' rusty, I swear...": "",
  "Don't be lookin'\nover here, scumbag!": "",
  "Hey, pass that over my way!": "",
  "I'm useless with a sword!": "",
  "This is all a man really needs.": "",
  "Take care of your sword and\nit'll take care of you.": "",
  "I can't wait to\nstart fighting for real!": "",
  "I'm the kinda guy who\nlikes to swing a sword!": "",
  "No one can beat\nme in a swordfight!": "",
  "If those are your orders, fine!": "",
  "This isn't how it'd\ngo in a real fight!": "",
  "Think you're so clever!?": "",
  "Should we take a break?": "",
  "Hey! Keep it down\ninside the barracks!": "",
  "Don't lose sight\nof your ambitions!": ""
 }
}